    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48521" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tonsa</span></b> , ae, f.
		perh. from tundo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>an oar</i> (<b>poet.</b>; mostly
			in plur.; syn. remus). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(a).</b>
			<i>Sing.</i>: in mari magno tenere tonsam, Enn. ap.
				<i><span class="en">Fest. p. 356</span></i> Müll. (Sota, v. 3
			Vahl. p. 164): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">valida tonsa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 1, 369</span></i>
			. — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b>
			<i>Plur.</i>, Enn. ap. <i><span class="en">Fest. p.
				356</span></i> Müll. (Ann. v. 232; 235; 236 Vahl.); <i><span class="en">Lucr. 2,
			554</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 7, 28</span></i>; <i><span class="en">10, 299</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Luc.
				3, 527</span></i>; <i><span class="en">5,
			448</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sil. 11, 492</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sen.
				Agam. 443 al.</span></i></div>
